## Funding

No funding was received in support of this study.

## Ethical approval

Ethical approval was not required. This study is a secondary analysis of publicly
available, de-identified, summary-level data released by the ENCODE Consortium,
the GTEx Consortium and the EMBL-EBI eQTL Catalogue, together with predictions
generated by a computational model. No individual-level data were accessed, no
human participants were recruited, and no identifiable personal information was
processed.

